{
  "uid": "asap-topk",
  "title": "Heavy hitters and new keys: sketch vs exact (real collector containers)",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Pipeline",
      "description": "Three pipelines that share no processor, fed identical points by their own generators (same seed and scenario start). Each box is one collector container pinned to its own CPU; arrows are OTLP/HTTP between containers.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 6px;border:none\"><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>generator-a/b</b><br><small>sources A and B</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>branch-a/b</b><br><small>Stage 1 per source: Count-Min 4&times;512 + top-20 heap per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>merge</b><br><small>Stage 2: merges both sources&#39; sketches per window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #5794f2;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(87,148,242,0.12)\"><b>detector</b><br><small>top-20 with bounds; new heavy hitters</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus + Loki</b><br><small>method=&quot;sketch&quot;</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-branch-a/b</b><br><small>Stage 1 per source: route &rarr; count map per 1-min window</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-merge</b><br><small>Stage 2: adds both sources&#39; exact windows</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #ff9830;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(255,152,48,0.10)\"><b>exact-detector</b><br><small>exact top-20; new heavy hitters</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>Prometheus + Loki</b><br><small>method=&quot;exact&quot; (ground truth)</small></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.10)\"><b>raw-generator-a/b</b><br><small>same points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.10)\"><b>raw-branch-a/b</b><br><small>Stage 1 per source: forwards every raw point</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.10)\"><b>raw-merge</b><br><small>Stage 2: forwards both sources&#39; raw points</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #8e8e8e;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:rgba(142,142,142,0.10)\"><b>raw-sink</b><br><small>writes every raw point; measures when the window&#39;s last point is stored</small></div></td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0 6px;color:#8e8e8e;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap\">&rarr;</td><td style=\"border:none;padding:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #6e7681;border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;background:none\"><b>loki-raw</b><br><small>one log record per raw point</small></div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:4px 0 0 0\"><small><b>hh-accuracy</b> (outside the pipelines) receives a copy of both detectors&#39; answers and, per window, compares the heavy hitters (routes with at least 1% of the window&#39;s points): precision, recall, F1 and average relative count error.</small></p>"
      },
      "id": 1
    },
